msgid "The Wobbly H.... The carousel.... The Luau...! And the Eiffel Tower!"
msgstr "Le H branlant... Le carrousel... Le Luau...! Et la tour Eiffel !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: hanks_hangers/hanks_love_divert/300
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's the wildest night of high-fiving you've ever had in your life."
msgstr "C'est la nuit de high-fives la plus folle que vous ayez jamais vécue."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: hanks_hangers/hanks_love_divert/320
